# Trivy ignore list for `trivy config` misconfiguration findings.
# DS-0026: HEALTHCHECK isn't usable here — the distroless runtime image has no
# shell/coreutils to run a check command against. Health monitoring is handled
# by Kubernetes liveness/readiness probes (k8s/deployment.yaml) instead, which
# is the primary deployment target for this template.
DS-0026
# KSV-0125: this check's built-in trust list only covers Azure ACR/AWS ECR/GCR
# (see aquasecurity/trivy-checks uses_untrusted_registry.rego) — it doesn't
# know about ghcr.io, which is this project's own registry, published to by
# our own signed CD pipeline (.github/workflows/cd.yml).
KSV-0125
